        "z": "8d24f276d123a072",
        "name": "Messages that fail go to the catch node",
        "info": "The producer has no Topic, so it uses `msg.topic`. Its offline queue is *Off*: while Kafka is unreachable, messages fail instead of being queued.",
        "x": 220,
